--------------------------------------------------
2. KEY API SYMBOLS & FUNCTIONS
--------------------------------------------------
* _DobbyHook                  -> Main function to place hooks in memory
* _DobbyInstrument            -> For monitoring and logging code execution
* _DobbyCodePatch             -> Directly patching binary code in memory
* _DobbyDestroy               -> Destroys and removes hooks
* _DobbyGetVersion            -> Returns the framework version
* _ClearCache / __clear_cache -> Clears CPU instruction cache after patching
* _common_closure_bridge_handler -> Handles routing between functions
